OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 20 DEC
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe pianist Simon Trpceski
OL,6,     Gperforms Brahms' second piano
OL,7,     Gconcerto with the Hungarian Radio
OL,8,     GSymphony Orchestra, conducted by
OL,9,     GRiccardo Frizza. After, more
OL,10,     GBrahms: his Symphony no 4.
OL,11,G0630FBreakfast
OL,12,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,13,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,14,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,15,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,16,     GTom hosts a Christmas party! With
OL,17,     Gsuperstar organist Anna Lapwood,
OL,18,     Gllive choral treats from Siglo de
OL,19,     GOro all morning and a tribute to
OL,20,     GA Charlie Brown Christmas Album.
